  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: '<color=#45A8FF><b>1  PRE-LAUNCH</b></color>

    Switch on both batteries on the overhead panel (key 6), press MAIN POWER, then bring every row of the GO / NO-GO board on the centre display to GO. Press LAUNCH SEQ to start the count.


    <color=#45A8FF><b>2  ATMOSPHERIC ASCENT</b></color>

    Set full throttle. At T-6 lift the guard and press ENGINE IGNITION. Ease the throttle back through max-Q and again if the G load climbs past 4.


    <color=#45A8FF><b>3  STAGE SEPARATION</b></color>

    When the booster burns out, lift the guard and press STAGE SEP, then press ENGINE IGNITION for the upper stage.


    <color=#45A8FF><b>4  ORBITAL INSERTION</b></color>

    Hold the burn. When ORBIT GO lights, press ENGINE CUTOFF.


    <color=#45A8FF><b>5  OUTER SPACE</b></color>

    You are in orbit. Switch GUIDANCE off and RCS on to fly the spacecraft by hand.'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
